(INSTRUCTIONS FOR CANDIDATE) Tj
0.00 -20.36 TD
(1. Roll No. Slip is provisional. Result will be quashed if found ineligible.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(2. Application for correction in this slip must receive before commencement of the examination.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(3. Keep this slip carefully along with your original CNIC, bring during the course of examination and show when required.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(4. The candidates are directed to keep their ears visible during the course of examination.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(5. The candidates are allowed to use scientific calculators without mini computers. Other tools like Mobile, Blue Tooth, Wireless Phones) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(    and Walky-Talky etc are not allowed to carry in the hall.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(6. Un-authorized change of Centre/Subject/Group is strictly prohibited. No mark of identification should be made on the answer book.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(7. Do not make any appeal to the examiner. Don't use obscene language in the answer book and don't misbehave with the supervisory) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(staff.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(8. Any Candidate who stages a walk out/boycott or instigates others to do so shall be liable for all the damages.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(9. If any student is found Expelled/Rusticated or involved in any illegal activity, at any stage, the Result will be quashed under the) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(University Rules.) Tj
0.00 -20.36 TD
(NOTE: Comply with the above instructions failing to which U.M.C. and F.I.R. will be registered.) Tj
0.00 -20.36 TD
(Covid-19 SOPs for Candidates:) Tj
0.00 -20.40 TD
(\(1\) Drinking water will not be served and candidates will bring their water bottles to avoid spread of Corona Virus.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(\(2\) The candidates must leave their cell phones and other belongings outside the Examination Centre.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(\(3\) The candidates will not be allowed to take exams if they did not wear face mask or if they refused to follow any of the SOPs.) Tj
0.00 -10.16 TD
(\(4\) The candidates will also bring their own hand sanitizers.) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(\(5\) The candidates will not be allowed to converge/gather in close contact in groups at the entry/exit points or anywhere in the premises of) Tj
0.00 -10.20 TD
(examination centre.) Tj
